  <PageHeader
    eyebrow="Legal"
    title="Terms of Service"
    lead="The terms on which this website and its content are made available."
    crumbs={[{ label: 'Terms of Service' }]}
    image="about"
    compact
  />
  <section class="legal">
    <div class="wrap">
      <p class="legal-updated">Last updated 7 September 2026</p>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>By using sbfallprotection.com you accept the terms below. If you do not agree with them, please do not use the website.</p>
        <h2>Information on this website</h2>
        <p>Product descriptions, specifications and certifications are provided for general information. They are checked carefully, but they do not form part of any contract. Specifications for an order are confirmed in the quotation and order documents issued by SB International.</p>
        <h2>Quotations and orders</h2>
        <p>Submitting an enquiry through this website is a request for a quotation, not an order. No contract exists until SB International issues a written order confirmation. Prices, lead times and minimum quantities are stated in the quotation.</p>
