        <h2>Changes</h2>
        <p>We may update these terms from time to time. The date at the top of this page shows when they were last changed.</p>
        <h2>Governing law</h2>
        <p>These terms are governed by the laws of India. Disputes are subject to the jurisdiction of the courts at Kanpur, Uttar Pradesh.</p>
        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>Questions about these terms can be sent to <a href="mailto:sales@sbfallprotection.com">sales@sbfallprotection.com</a>.</p>
      </div>
      <p class="legal-credit">This website was designed and developed by
        <a href="https://aijugaad.co/ig" target="_blank" rel="noopener">AI Jugaad</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
